- `bin/verify-fast.sh`: **=== All checks passed ===** (486 tests, 1746 assertions).
- Impersonation regression watch (14 tests, 41 assertions) green.
- grep confirms no `serialize`/`unserialize` calls remain in the impersonation flow.

