- `bin/verify-fast.sh`: **=== All checks passed ===** (486 tests, 1746 assertions).

No spec mismatch, no weak/fake/skipped tests, no security regression (it's a net hardening — removes a deserialization-gadget amplifier and makes exit fail-closed), no production config changes, no dead UI.

One non-blocking note (documented, not a required fix): the exit audit row is logged with outcome `success` even on the fail-closed path.

