**Security is sound** — the DNS-rebind TOCTOU is closed (resolve once → validate all → pin to validated IP), non-http(s) schemes are rejected unconditionally regardless of the switch, and unparseable IPs fail closed.

**Tests are real, not faked** — 40 unit + 3 functional, no skips/early-returns/weakened assertions. The full suite (558 tests) passes; the legacy static-guard test and config-page test stay green, and the `ControlledHttpWebhookDispatcher` double still constructs thanks to the nullable `$guard` default.

**No production config weakened** — only the admin `WebhookConfigPage` gains the operator switch, which is the feature itself.

